<title>USA: Apple Orthodontix IPO price range lowered.</title>
<headline>Apple Orthodontix IPO price range lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range was lowered for the planned initial public offering in Apple Orthodontix Inc to $7 to $8, from $8 to $9 previously, lead underwriter Bear Stearns said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The reduction marks the second time the planned initial public offering's price was lowered; the original estimated price range was $10 to $12.</p>
<p>The proposed number of shares remain 2.35 million shares under the symbol &quot;AOI&quot; on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Apple Orthodontix, an orthodontix business, is expected to trade on Friday.</p>
